{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]The boat is tossed upon the [Bb]deep
[Cm]The waves are rising, fierce and [Ab]steep
[Eb]Disciples wake the sleeping [Bb]man
[Cm]Lord, save us from the stor[Ab]ming span
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
